            "review_title": "Review at Co Ngu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Teyramisu\n85 contributions\n0\nFirst Dinner in Vietnam\nDec 2016 • Friends\nWe were brought to this restaurant after a tiring day tour in Ho Chi Minh. It was a fancy restaurant on the outside with a garden that is a cool sight to the eyes. We didn't expect that we will be accompanied in a quiet room with a few tables. Our meal was pre-ordered by the agency, and our menu was displayed on our table. The quantity of the serving is not uniform for each meal, we craved for more shrimp, if given the chance. Overall, the quantity of the food served was more than enough for three people, and we left the restaurant with happy tummies.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 17, 2017",
