            "review_title": "Review at Co Ngu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "tekisui h\nclifton,nj8 contributions\n0\nVery bad service with bad attitude\nJun 2014 • Friends\nWe order a party for 30 persons in May 2013 , we had a special room for our party which's very nice. The service is good but the food is so little, plane taste and so expensive.\nWith 5 courses ( each course only have 1/2 of regular dish) and drink ( soda & water ) for 30 person cost us 330 $US.\nAnother time, my family come to Co Ngu restaurant to have a dinner. We called an orange juice, but we got a spoil & dilute orange juice. After our complaint a waiter took a drink back, then 15 minutes later he brought a ice tea drink for us without explanation why. When we got a bill they still charged us a price of orange juice and keep a $ change.( 80,000$ VN) \nWith all the reasons above we not recommend any one should come to the Co Ngu restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City..\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 25, 2015",
