            "review_title": "Review at Co Ngu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MarmeFIN\nHelsinki, Finland94 contributions\n0\nGo here if you like attractive females and good food!\nJan 2014 • Friends\nOur hotel stuff recommends this place.\n\nFirst of all - owner of this place have eye for beautiful girls – all the female waitresses were young and very attractive. Sadly they didn’t spoke any English, so no wife for me snif :-(\n\nWe got our table from second flood. \n\nI ate Spain beef, and it was amazingly good! No complaints. \n\nAll liked their food, but the concept of dessert was unknown to them so we fulfilled our sugar rush elsewhere.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 3, 2014",
