            "review_text": "B0X\nMonmouth, United Kingdom35 contributions\n0\nGreat food and service\nMar 2013 • Couples\nWe found this by accident - and what a find it was. We ate in the courtyard which is a great setting. The food was some of the best Vietnamese we have had - not the cheapest but the quality was high. They also served a passable house white wine much to the delight of my wife.\nService was exceptional even by Vietnamese standards.\nGive it a try.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 23, 2013",
